{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：20:11 2026-10-19 HKT</p>\n<p>屯門兆康路一屋苑，今日（10月19日）下午近1時，警方接獲一名母親報案，指發現其47歲姓謝兒子從家中高處墮下。警員接報到場，發現謝男倒臥平台，當場死亡。警方於現場沒有檢獲遺書，其尋死死因有待調查。據了解，男子受精神疾病所困。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T12:19:34.590754+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":0,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T12:11:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T15:17:53.450780+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T12:17:40.179494+00:00","content_hash":"ef8ca5af028a1458d8eb9c9b14a73b84bd4988166d19cafb9dcc974abcf67b5b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}